WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Admin → Locations → Edit location → Sending for the intended store.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Enter its sender email and Resend API key, and enable automatic supplier emails.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Press Save settings and check the saved sending status.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: In Suppliers &amp; delivery, separately set each supplier to Email and save the recipient.
